SDK patch 0311 (Max Payne 3 port): x360_traza_fetch_escalado. One log line every ~10 s per distinct
scale a resolved texture was fetched with: base, the fetch's exp_adjust, the exp_previo its resolve baked
in, and whether the read went through a scaled copy. The scene and the bloom chain resolve the same EDRAM
address through several format views with different copy exp biases; a net power of two that is off is
what whitens the tonemap's input (the 2^-4 the Xbox-frame fit found). Default off.

--- a/src/x360/deko/texturas.cpp
+++ b/src/x360/deko/texturas.cpp
@@ -63,12 +63,18 @@
